Incident Triage with Python Automation
Objectives
By the end of this lab, students will be able to:

Automate security alert analysis and filtering using Python
Implement rule-based systems to identify false positives
Calculate priority scores for incident classification
Build automated triage workflows for SIEM alerts
Generate incident reports and recommendations
Prerequisites
Basic Python programming (functions, loops, conditionals, dictionaries)
Understanding of security concepts (alerts, incidents, severity levels)
Familiarity with JSON data format
Linux command line basics
