Troubleshooting Tips
Issue: JSON parsing errors

Verify JSON syntax with python3 -m json.tool data/sample_alerts.json
Check for missing commas, brackets, or quotes
Ensure proper UTF-8 encoding
Issue: Priority scores seem incorrect

Review severity_weights and alert_type_weights in rules
Verify calculation logic includes all factors
Print intermediate score values for debugging
Issue: All alerts marked as false positives

Check whitelist configuration is not too broad
Verify is_whitelisted() logic checks correct fields
Test with alerts that should not match whitelist
Issue: File not found errors

Verify working directory is ~/incident_triage_lab
Check file paths are relative to working directory
Use absolute paths if needed: os.path.join(os.getcwd(), 'data', 'file.json')
